1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
That metal rattle

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:05,000
when you hit the gas?

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,600
Gets louder as you speed up,

4
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:11,000
quiets down at idle?

5
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:14,000
Most of the time,

6
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:18,000
it's the heat shield.

7
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Leave it long enough

8
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,000
and it wears through.

9
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Do not guess.

10
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Free underneath check. Link in bio.
